        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "framing",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "**Two Unity AI Gateway paths -- this dashboard shows legacy endpoint data only.** Endpoint AI Gateway overlay (legacy v1/v2, being deprecated): workspace serving endpoint `ai-gateway-deepdive` -- usage tracking, access control, payload logging, guardrails (PII and safety), and traffic split (70/30 llama/claude). The endpoint enforces RPM/TPM rate limits with real HTTP 429 (verified live); a calls=0 setting additionally hard-blocks (HTTP 403) -- the documented migration off-ramp. UC model service (v3, GA): `aigw_demo_service` (notebooks 01-04 + the App model-service tab) also produces real HTTP 429 and service-policy blocks; its traffic is NOT captured in aigw_payload. The model service's edge is UC-native governance, not rate limiting itself. **Note:** Inference table is best-effort with approx 2h ingestion lag. Source: ai_gateway_deepdive_catalog.core.aigw_payload. _GA/Beta status, enforcement rollout, and deprecation dates are subject to change; verify against current Databricks documentation._"
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 1,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 2
          }
        },
